    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Inbox Assistant: start here\nEvery new email in Gmail is read by AI, labelled (AI/Sales lead, AI/Customer support, AI/Billing...), summarised and, if someone is waiting for an answer, a reply is saved in **Drafts** for you to check. It never sends email on your behalf. Sales leads and urgent mail trigger an alert, and everything is logged to a Google Sheet.\n\n**Setup (about 10 minutes)**\n1. Copy the log sheet template (tab `Inbox log`).\n2. Open **Settings**: your name, business, facts the AI may use in replies, signature, alert address, sheet URL.\n3. Connect credentials: Gmail, OpenAI, Google Sheets.\n4. Activate. Labels are created automatically the first time they're needed.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "27ddc85b-d132-5fd6-a4e0-13743ebaee01",
      "name": "Note: start here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Each email, one at a time\nAI triage → label → draft reply (if needed) → alert (leads & urgent) → log. Alerts are tagged `[Inbox Assistant]` and are ignored by the trigger, so it never loops on its own mail.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "815a4fc6-c104-5714-b1b2-5363e412b0c8",
      "name": "Note: per email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        -320
      ]
    }
